      "writtenOn": "2021-03-08T20:26:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since this is an optimization that is supported by just one vendor, I think it\u0027s best to tie this to it\u0027s own capability at the HAL level.\n\nI updated the HOW TO doc with directions on how to do this.  I also used this use case in the example.\n\nFYI, the change to prevent blocking when getting the capabilities is pending code review.",
      "revId": "29bd6a45f5f46c53a5082e83035d9ffc9a0160c3",
