      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-05T20:08:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "we shouldn\u0027t depend on doing this math.  We need a status included which can give error indications and a terminal indication.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 139,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 139,
        "endChar": 99
